    "answer": {
      "short": "$\\$10.50$",
      "worked": "Each extra scoop costs: $\\$6.25 - \\$5.40 = \\$0.85$\nFixed cost (the zero-scoop intercept): $\\$5.40 - \\$0.85 = \\$4.55$\nEquation: $y = 0.85x + 4.55$\nFor 7 scoops ($x = 7$):\n$y = 0.85(7) + 4.55 = 5.95 + 4.55 = \\$10.50$",
